    counter-clockwise, in a diagonal pattern.
  wrongDirectionHelp: This motor spins the wrong way for this arm. Two motors must
    spin clockwise (CW) and two counter-clockwise (CCW), in a diagonal pattern. Swap
    it with the motor on the diagonal.
